    "A Steam client update may break Bridgeplay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un aggiornamento del client Steam potrebbe rendere Bridgeplay inutilizzabile."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Обновление клиента Steam может сломать Bridgeplay."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 客户端更新可能导致 Bridgeplay 无法使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A faster way for the game's threads to wait on each other. Leave it on unless a game hangs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un modo più veloce per far attendere i thread del gioco tra loro. Lascialo attivo, a meno che un gioco si blocchi."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Более быстрый способ синхронизации потоков игры. Оставьте включённым, если игра не зависает."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让游戏线程更快地相互等待。除非游戏卡住，否则保持开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fork of [NotProton](https://github.com/NotProtonNot/NotProton), running on [CodeWeavers](https://www.codeweavers.com)' open-source Wine and Apple's Game Porting Toolkit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un fork di [NotProton](https://github.com/NotProtonNot/NotProton), che usa il Wine open source di [CodeWeavers](https://www.codeweavers.com) e il Game Porting Toolkit di Apple."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Форк [NotProton](https://github.com/NotProtonNot/NotProton) на открытом Wine от [CodeWeavers](https://www.codeweavers.com) и Game Porting Toolkit от Apple."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[NotProton](https://github.com/NotProtonNot/NotProton) 的分支，基于 [CodeWeavers](https://www.codeweavers.com) 的开源 Wine 和 Apple 的 Game Porting Toolkit 运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game is running, so Bridgeplay won't restart. The update installs when you quit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "È in esecuzione un gioco, quindi Bridgeplay non si riavvierà. L'aggiornamento verrà installato quando chiudi l'app."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Игра запущена, поэтому Bridgeplay не перезапустится. Обновление установится при выходе."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有游戏正在运行，因此 Bridgeplay 不会重启。退出时会安装更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game or Wine tool is running on build %@. Quit it before removing Bridgeplay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un gioco o uno strumento di Wine è in esecuzione sulla build %@. Chiudilo prima di rimuovere Bridgeplay."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Игра или инструмент Wine запущены в сборке %@. Завершите их перед удалением Bridgeplay."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有游戏或 Wine 工具正在使用构建版本 %@。请先退出，再移除 Bridgeplay。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
