    },
    "Apple's Game Porting Toolkit (D3DMetal) runs DirectX 11 and 12 games on Metal. Bridgeplay can download it for you under Apple's non-commercial license, or add your own copy from Apple." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il Game Porting Toolkit di Apple (D3DMetal) esegue i giochi DirectX 11 e 12 su Metal. Bridgeplay può scaricarlo per te con la licenza non commerciale di Apple, oppure aggiungi una tua copia da Apple."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Game Porting Toolkit от Apple (D3DMetal) запускает игры на DirectX 11 и 12 через Metal. Bridgeplay может скачать его для вас по некоммерческой лицензии Apple или добавить вашу копию от Apple."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple 的 Game Porting Toolkit（D3DMetal）可通过 Metal 运行 DirectX 11 和 12 游戏。Bridgeplay 可以按 Apple 的非商业许可为你下载它，你也可以添加自己从 Apple 下载的副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's performance overlay: frame rate, frame time and GPU use." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'overlay delle prestazioni di Apple: frame rate, tempo di frame e uso della GPU."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Оверлей производительности Apple: частота кадров, время кадра и загрузка GPU."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple 的性能叠层：帧率、帧时间和 GPU 占用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's translator for Windows games. Asks for your Mac password." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il traduttore di Apple per i giochi Windows. Chiede la password del Mac."
