        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay %@ готов к установке"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay %@ 已可安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay Components" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Componenti di Bridgeplay"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Компоненты Bridgeplay"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay 组件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay adds a library to Steam.app and re-signs Steam on this Mac. Valve doesn't support this, and it may go against Steam's terms. Repair Steam in Status undoes it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay aggiunge una libreria a Steam.app e ri-firma Steam su questo Mac. Valve non lo supporta e potrebbe violare i termini di Steam. “Ripara Steam” in Stato lo annulla."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay добавляет библиотеку в Steam.app и заново подписывает Steam на этом Mac. Valve это не поддерживает, и это может нарушать условия Steam. Кнопка «Восстановить Steam» на вкладке «Состояние» отменяет изменения."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay 会向 Steam.app 添加一个库，并在这台 Mac 上为 Steam 重新签名。Valve 不支持这样做，也可能违反 Steam 的条款。在“状态”中修复 Steam 即可撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay adds itself to Steam, sets up the WineCX engine and makes it Steam's default. Steam closes for a moment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay si aggiunge a Steam, configura il motore WineCX e lo imposta come predefinito di Steam. Steam si chiude per un momento."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay добавляется в Steam, настраивает движок WineCX и делает его движком Steam по умолчанию. Steam ненадолго закроется."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay 会将自己添加到 Steam，配置 WineCX 引擎并将其设为 Steam 的默认引擎。Steam 会短暂关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay can't read its %@. An antivirus or endpoint protection app may be blocking it. Allow the file, or exclude Bridgeplay.app, then reinstall Bridgeplay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay non riesce a leggere il file %@. Un antivirus o un'app di protezione endpoint potrebbe bloccarlo. Consenti il file, oppure escludi Bridgeplay.app, quindi reinstalla Bridgeplay."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay не может прочитать файл %@. Возможно, его блокирует антивирус или программа защиты. Разрешите этот файл или добавьте Bridgeplay.app в исключения, затем переустановите Bridgeplay."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay 无法读取 %@。杀毒软件或终端防护应用可能阻止了该文件。请允许该文件，或将 Bridgeplay.app 加入排除列表，然后重新安装 Bridgeplay。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay cannot use Steam from a folder with a colon in its name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay non può usare Steam da una cartella con i due punti nel nome."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay не может использовать Steam из папки с двоеточием в имени."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay 无法使用名称中含有冒号的文件夹中的 Steam。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay carries no components." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay non contiene componenti."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "В Bridgeplay нет компонентов."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay 未包含任何组件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay could not download the files it needs from %@. Please try again later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay non è riuscito a scaricare da %@ i file che gli servono. Riprova più tardi."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay не удалось скачать нужные файлы с %@. Повторите попытку позже."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay 无法从 %@ 下载所需文件。请稍后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay could not move its files to the new Bridgeplay folders: %@ Try again or skip it on the Status page first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay non è riuscito a spostare i suoi file nelle nuove cartelle di Bridgeplay: %@ Riprova oppure salta prima il passaggio dalla pagina Stato."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay не удалось переместить файлы в новые папки Bridgeplay: %@ Повторите попытку или сначала пропустите этот шаг на странице «Состояние»."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay 无法将文件移动到新的 Bridgeplay 文件夹：%@ 请重试，或先在“状态”页面中跳过此步骤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay could not reach %@'s servers. Check your internet connection. A firewall app (such as LuLu or Little Snitch), VPN or proxy may also be blocking Bridgeplay. Allow it and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay non è riuscito a raggiungere i server di %@. Controlla la connessione a internet. Anche un'app firewall (come LuLu o Little Snitch), una VPN o un proxy potrebbero bloccare Bridgeplay. Consentine l'accesso e riprova."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay не удалось подключиться к серверам %@. Проверьте подключение к интернету. Подключению Bridgeplay также могут мешать брандмауэр (например, LuLu или Little Snitch), VPN или прокси. Разрешите ему доступ и повторите попытку."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay 无法连接 %@ 服务器。请检查网络连接。防火墙应用（如 LuLu 或 Little Snitch）、VPN 或代理也可能阻止了 Bridgeplay。请允许其访问，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay could not save this setting. %@" : {
