            "value" : "此 Mac 已信任 Bridgeplay。下次更新后，控制器仍会保留权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay lives in Steam" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay vive in Steam"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay работает в Steam"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay 就在 Steam 中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay needs the App Management permission. Turn on Bridgeplay in System Settings › Privacy & Security › App Management. After a Bridgeplay update the switch can look on but no longer work: turn it off and on again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay ha bisogno del permesso Gestione app. Attiva Bridgeplay in Impostazioni di Sistema › Privacy e sicurezza › Gestione app. Dopo un aggiornamento di Bridgeplay l'interruttore può sembrare attivo ma non funzionare più: disattivalo e riattivalo."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay нужно разрешение «Управление приложениями». Включите Bridgeplay в Системных настройках › Конфиденциальность и безопасность › Управление приложениями. После обновления Bridgeplay переключатель может выглядеть включённым, но не работать: выключите и снова включите его."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay 需要“App 管理”权限。请在“系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › App 管理”中开启 Bridgeplay。Bridgeplay 更新后，开关可能显示为开启，但实际已失效：请将其关闭再重新开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay removes these settings from the game's conf and keeps a copy in its backups folder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay rimuove queste impostazioni dal conf del gioco e ne conserva una copia nella sua cartella dei backup."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay удаляет эти настройки из conf игры и хранит копию в своей папке резервных копий."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay 会从该游戏的 conf 中移除这些设置，并在其备份文件夹中保留一份副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay runs Windows games from your Steam library. First, a few quick checks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay esegue i giochi Windows della tua libreria Steam. Prima, qualche rapido controllo."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay запускает игры для Windows из вашей библиотеки Steam. Сначала несколько быстрых проверок."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay 可运行你 Steam 游戏库中的 Windows 游戏。首先，进行几项快速检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay sets the game up and the game prepares its graphics, which can show a black screen for a few minutes. Later launches are quick." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay configura il gioco e il gioco prepara la grafica: per qualche minuto potresti vedere una schermata nera. I prossimi avvii sono rapidi."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay настраивает игру, а игра готовит графику, поэтому несколько минут может быть чёрный экран. Следующие запуски будут быстрыми."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay 会配置游戏，游戏则会准备图形资源，期间可能出现几分钟的黑屏。之后再启动就很快了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay successfully installed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay installato correttamente."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay успешно установлен."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay 安装成功。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay update for Steam" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aggiornamento di Bridgeplay per Steam"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Обновление Bridgeplay для Steam"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 的 Bridgeplay 更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay updated its files in Steam." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay ha aggiornato i suoi file in Steam."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay обновил свои файлы в Steam."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay 已更新其在 Steam 中的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay's %@ doesn't match its pinned checksum. An antivirus or endpoint protection app may have changed it. Allow the file, or exclude Bridgeplay.app, then reinstall Bridgeplay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il file %@ di Bridgeplay non corrisponde al checksum previsto. Un antivirus o un'app di protezione endpoint potrebbe averlo modificato. Consenti il file, oppure escludi Bridgeplay.app, quindi reinstalla Bridgeplay."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Файл %@ в Bridgeplay не совпадает с ожидаемой контрольной суммой. Возможно, его изменил антивирус или программа защиты. Разрешите этот файл или добавьте Bridgeplay.app в исключения, затем переустановите Bridgeplay."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bridgeplay 的 %@ 与预设校验值不符。杀毒软件或终端防护应用可能修改了该文件。请允许该文件，或将 Bridgeplay.app 加入排除列表，然后重新安装 Bridgeplay。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bridgeplay's default." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Predefinito di Bridgeplay."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
