    "Steam account" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Account Steam"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Учётная запись Steam"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 账户"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam at %@ isn't connected, so Bridgeplay can't be removed from it. All other Bridgeplay data is removed, except for Windows Games and prefixes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam in %@ non è collegato, quindi Bridgeplay non può esserne rimosso. Tutti gli altri dati di Bridgeplay vengono rimossi, tranne i giochi Windows e i prefissi."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam в %@ не подключён, поэтому удалить из него Bridgeplay не получится. Остальные данные Bridgeplay будут удалены, кроме игр Windows и префиксов."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "位于 %@ 的 Steam 未连接，因此无法从中移除 Bridgeplay。其他所有 Bridgeplay 数据都会被移除，但 Windows 游戏及游戏容器除外。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam at %@ isn't connected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam in %@ non è collegato."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam в %@ не подключён."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "位于 %@ 的 Steam 未连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam client updates are allowed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gli aggiornamenti del client Steam sono consentiti."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Обновления клиента Steam разрешены."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已允许 Steam 客户端更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam client updates are blocked." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gli aggiornamenti del client Steam sono bloccati."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Обновления клиента Steam заблокированы."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已阻止 Steam 客户端更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam client updates may break Bridgeplay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gli aggiornamenti del client Steam potrebbero rendere Bridgeplay inutilizzabile."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Обновления клиента Steam могут сломать Bridgeplay."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 客户端更新可能导致 Bridgeplay 无法使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam client updates may break Bridgeplay. If you don't want to wait for Bridgeplay to be updated to be compatible with future Steam versions at the cost of not getting updates to the Steam client, you can stop the Steam client from updating itself. You also miss Steam's security fixes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gli aggiornamenti del client Steam potrebbero rendere Bridgeplay inutilizzabile. Se non vuoi aspettare che Bridgeplay venga aggiornato per le future versioni di Steam, puoi impedire al client Steam di aggiornarsi, rinunciando però ai suoi aggiornamenti. Non ricevi nemmeno le correzioni di sicurezza di Steam."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Обновления клиента Steam могут сломать Bridgeplay. Если вы не хотите ждать, пока Bridgeplay обновится для совместимости с новыми версиями Steam, и готовы не получать обновления клиента, можно запретить клиенту Steam обновляться самому. Тогда вы также не получите исправления безопасности Steam."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 客户端更新可能导致 Bridgeplay 无法使用。你可以阻止 Steam 自动更新，避免等待 Bridgeplay 适配新版本，但这也意味着无法及时获得 Steam 客户端的功能改进和安全更新。你也无法获得 Steam 的安全修复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam closes for a moment and opens again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam si chiude per un momento e poi si riapre."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam ненадолго закроется и откроется снова."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 会短暂关闭，然后重新打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam could not be fully restored. Please run Repair Steam again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non è stato possibile ripristinare completamente Steam. Esegui di nuovo Ripara Steam."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Не удалось полностью восстановить Steam. Запустите «Восстановить Steam» ещё раз."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未能完全恢复 Steam。请再次执行“修复 Steam”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam did not quit. Choose Steam > Quit Steam, then try again. If Steam does not respond, quit it in Activity Monitor." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam non si è chiuso. Scegli Steam > Esci da Steam, poi riprova. Se Steam non risponde, chiudilo da Monitoraggio Attività."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam не завершился. Выберите Steam > Выйти из Steam и повторите попытку. Если Steam не отвечает, завершите его в Мониторинге системы."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 未能退出。请选择“Steam”>“退出 Steam”，然后重试。如果 Steam 没有响应，请在“活动监视器”中退出它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam has a different copy of Bridgeplay, and this account cannot update it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam ha una copia diversa di Bridgeplay e questo account non può aggiornarla."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "В Steam установлена другая копия Bridgeplay, и эта учётная запись не может её обновить."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 中有另一份 Bridgeplay，而此账户无法更新它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam has a different copy of Bridgeplay, installed by another account on this Mac. Update Bridgeplay from that account, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam ha una copia diversa di Bridgeplay, installata da un altro account su questo Mac. Aggiorna Bridgeplay da quell'account, poi riprova."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "В Steam установлена другая копия Bridgeplay, добавленная другой учётной записью на этом Mac. Обновите Bridgeplay из той учётной записи и повторите попытку."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 中的另一份 Bridgeplay 是由本机其他账户安装的。请使用该账户更新 Bridgeplay，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam has a newer build" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam ha una build più recente"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "В Steam более новая сборка"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 有较新的版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam has not been set up for Bridgeplay, and this account cannot change it. Install from the account that owns Steam." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam non è stato configurato per Bridgeplay e questo account non può modificarlo. Installa dall'account a cui appartiene Steam."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam не настроен для Bridgeplay, и эта учётная запись не может его изменить. Выполните установку из учётной записи, которой принадлежит Steam."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 尚未配置 Bridgeplay，当前账户无权修改。请使用安装 Steam 的账户执行安装。"
